      "Abstract": {"AbstractText": "Resuscitation using the BATLS method comes first. Effective analgesia is an essential part of casualty management. Methods used depend on your training, the number of casualties, the resources available and the injuries to be managed. Start simple, for example, splint limbs and cool burns. Effective analgesia may need a combination of techniques and drugs. If unsure, get help."},
